      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists just want to talk about \"coping mechanisms\" and \"progress\" but they don't get that it doesn't matter. even when i'm doing \"good\" it just feels like i'm waiting for the next crash. it's like a debt that's always coming due. i'm just so drained. there's no winning, there's just more fighting. it feels so pointless.",
